  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women, men and young people exercise citizenship, promoting social inclusion in the department of Huehuetenango.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young women in the municipality of Aguacatn, Huehuetenango, face barriers to fully contribute to the development of their communities. Red Maya, Cedimujer (REDMAYA) provides training to young female leaders to develop their management fundraising, negotiation, critical thinking, and leadership skills. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to strengthen governance in Guatemala. REDMAYA&apos;s activities strengthen grassroots organizations through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
